{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Urban Chord Studio 是為製作人、音樂人與節拍製作人而設的作曲輔助 App，能在無需樂理知識下快速生成專業和絃，協助擺脫空白專案帶來的作曲瓶頸。用戶可選擇音樂類型、探索不同和絃變化，並以豐富音色試聽氛圍。此 App 原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-121.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>和絃靈感與音色引擎</h2>\n<p>內建超過 20 種音樂類型，涵蓋 Lo-Fi、Neo-Soul、Trap、Jazz、Cinematic、Pop 與 Rock，並提供 7 度、9 度、13 度等進階和絃聲部，讓複雜和聲更易掌握。用戶可切換柱式和絃、琶音與掃弦模式，配合 Pads、Strings、Bass、Leads 等高品質合成音色、殘響與 BPM 調校，快速試聽和絃進程的流動與氣氛；復古未來風 VFD 介面亦令創作更直觀。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-112-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-113-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-114-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-115-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Urban Chord Studio</li><li>應用類別：Music</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/urban-chord-studio/id6758878604?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.583857+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":396,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T14:38:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:16:04.106509+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:43.288904+00:00","content_hash":"564efd57102dc9790f5686a85bb0e886c5039e7c0b8d8b2d077ed37ac09ade6b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}